<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The moment I put my shoes on, my body refused.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shoes were things you wore to walk outside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So my body refused.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was already worn out from all the walking today...<PG>
And yet, what is this situation!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why am I holding these things!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In my two hands, a nata and a mace.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What are they for, you ask!? Hunting! Hunting!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We're hunting in the mountains, with the sun already down and not a single streetlight!<PG>
And on top of that, me, a total hunting amateur, going hunting with gear like this!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the commentary I kept running through my head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It all started when <STYLE ID="1">Obaasan</STYLE> began her impression... 
{PAUSE ""}
and then <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> egged me on...<PG>
That's right! It's <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s fault!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she hadn't lured me with food back then, none of this would have...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at the same time, I began to feel that I was partly to blame too, for taking the bait.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you okay? You look all out of energy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? Oh, yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course I'm out of energy!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now I fully understood why <STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> had called her a <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ましら">monkey</STYLE>.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! I'll just do the hunting any old way, so you go rest, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And with that, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> snatched my nata and mace away from me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Rest where...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I know a good place! It's real close to here, so come on!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ugh... Is it really a good place...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を歩く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地入口.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
Don't tell me she wants to drag out a bear that lives in here and hunt it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Get in!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My legs were completely refusing to walk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I noticed <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> was hugging something like a big bag.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, what's that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, this? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\カエル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">　It's a giant bullfrog! You ate some earlier, remember?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ugh...! A f-frog...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\flog.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> thrust out at me a frog like a big stuffed bear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was clearly bigger than my face.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Wh-what are you going to do with it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ehehe! With this, our hunt's over! That's okay, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Come on, the hunt's over now! </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Get in!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And with that, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> went briskly off into the hole.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Being left alone in a place like this was more than I could take.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I went after <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed my body had chosen going into the hole over being alone.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, are you there...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Of course I'm here! Come on, hurry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From under the moonlight outside, into the dark hole.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The contrast made it feel even darker.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my eyes soon adjusted, and my vision began to clear.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地内部.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Amazing... It's like you can see the light...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe because of the rain earlier, a faint mist hung in the air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The mist raised pillars of light inside the cave, which should have been dark, and made a natural neon sign.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"This place is my secret base!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And with that, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> crouched and touched the rush mat spread on the ground.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmm, it's still a little </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, but it's probably okay. So it rained a bit around here too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, the rain from earlier must have come in from above.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But then, that's a little strange.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where does the rain that falls in here go?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is there a gap somewhere?<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, are you sure about the hunt? </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Your grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> might be catching a big one."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"It's fine, it's fine! Forget that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">old hag</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, forget her! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　I'm not so mean I'd work a tired </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> to the bone!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could she be looking out for me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Letting me take it easy here, so I wouldn't get any more tired―<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Thanks, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Don't mention it, don't mention it! It's finally just me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, so I wanted to talk about all kinds of stuff! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Let us talk as sisters!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... But you've got </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Sure, I've got my </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">real sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're going home the day after tomorrow, right? So unless it's a chance like this..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly I thought of <STYLE ID="8">my own sister</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Sis</STYLE> and I hadn't properly talked in the last few years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet we used to be close sisters...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地内部.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I've got a </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">real sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Whoa! So does she have big boobs!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh...!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　That's... I don't know..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You don't know...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Could it be... you two don't get along...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see... Sisters who don't even know each other's boob size, that's pretty bad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's with that yardstick...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I'm happy you said we're sisters. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I want a sister I get along with too. If you'll have someone like me, let's stay sisters."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I offered, once again, a bond as sisters.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s face was stern.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If you're gonna say that, I quit being sisters."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, that's wrong! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Your real sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and you don't get along, so you'll be sisters with me? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　That's weird!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"But..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"You've gotta get along with your </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">real sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　You can't get along as real sisters, so it's sisters with me? Am I a stand-in for your </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Once you get along with your </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you won't need me anymore!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Th-that's not it..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I like my </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">real sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But I like </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too. I want it to be like that for </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You'd hate staying like this forever, never making up, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Well... sure, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and I had a </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="けんか">fight</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. This past New Year's."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I remember right, they argued over whether or not <STYLE ID="10">Kotaro-san</STYLE> was the culprit.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> says </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s the culprit behind the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I hate that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地月光.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
