<STYLE ID="3">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But I thought it over again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Then who would the culprit have to be for me to be okay with it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If the culprit's someone from this settlement, I'd hate it no matter who it was. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So if </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, feeling the same, says </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s the culprit... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> must be hurting too..."</STYLE><PG>
Faced with <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> saying something so unexpectedly grown-up, I couldn't say a thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
About sisters getting along, about the culprit, she had thought far harder than someone like me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I had all but given up on the sister thing, and with the curse-killings, all I'd thought about was pinning down the culprit.<PG>
But <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> is different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her sister matters, the people of the settlement matter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And still the curse-killings don't stop.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the moment I realized how presumptuous my thinking was.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm pretty sure the culprit is someone in the settlement. That can't be changed anymore, so it can't be helped, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, do you want to find the culprit?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I dunno... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If it's like </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> says and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s the culprit... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I bet I'd never forgive </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Never forgive...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
