{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Because all this time he'd have been </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="だま">fooling</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> everyone and killing people, wouldn't he? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Someone like that, even if it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">No, because it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I can't forgive him."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And with that, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> tightly gripped the nata she was holding.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I've made up my mind. If I find out who the culprit behind the curse-killings is, I won't forgive them, whoever it is."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I don't remember </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But everyone still cares about </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> even now, and that makes me happy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But... somewhere in their hearts, they must think the curse-killings are happening because of </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s curse. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If people think that about my dead </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mommy</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too... I could never forgive that...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"So... you've decided to kill the culprit?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After a short pause, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> slowly nodded.<PG>
It's just as <STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE> said. <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> is going to attack the culprit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>'s justice, her duty to the settlement, the shape of her love for her <STYLE ID="12">mother</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, no matter what happens, killing is not okay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Killing people is wrong."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why? Can you say the same thing about this frog?"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's not like we absolutely had to hunt this frog to survive, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　It got turned into a tool for a contest, didn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\雲わすれの夏.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地月光.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"In morals class... they told me, 'Let's think about why we must not kill people.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But the rule that you can't kill people is weird in the first place. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, what's the reason animals are okay but people aren't?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What am I supposed to answer in a case like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Human rights violations? Not doing what you'd hate to have done to you? Because humanity would be wiped out?<PG>
Most likely, reasoning like that won't work on <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it's human rights violations, then what about the Animal Welfare Act?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it's what you'd hate to have done to you, animals must hate it too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it's because humanity would be wiped out, animals would be wiped out too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, I'm no good at philosophical stuff...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I've got a rule when I hunt animals. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If I find a parent and its baby, I hunt them both. 'Cause the one left behind would be pitiful. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The reason you can't kill is probably 'cause the one left behind is pitiful. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So then you just kill both. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The ones that get killed aren't aware of anything, so they can't feel sad or suffer."</STYLE><PG>
In other words, murder is wrong because the people left behind grieve.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only ones against killing are, in the end, the living.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The dead can no longer think about it or even perceive it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's saying it's the selfishness of the living.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"So I think it's okay to kill people nobody would be sad about if they died. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Isn't that why there's the death penalty? If everyone wants somebody dead, it's fine for them to die."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A view of life and death far too dry and detached.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A view of life and death that could only come from hunting so many animals and taking so many lives at her age.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... There's one more reason you can't kill."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I don't want you to kill people, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I don't want you to become a </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> who kills people on nothing but her own judgment."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's just... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s own selfish opinion."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s opinion is a selfish one too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"If I say I don't want you to, will you not kill the culprit?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why don't you want me to kill?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I hate it when people die. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">That's why I want to solve the curse-killings too, and, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I don't want you killing anyone either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Is that not good enough...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, haven't even the animals you hunted sometimes attacked to protect their families?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"They have, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's the same thing. I don't want to see my family or friends die. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">No, I don't want my family or friends to kill, either."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Because </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> hates it, you're telling me not to kill?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Is that selfish...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> gave a slight nod.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Okay. I won't do anything </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> hates. 'Cause I don't wanna do anything that makes </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> sad."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Thank you..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But if I have to kill the culprit to protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'll kill."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that point the line is hard to draw, but could it count as self-defense?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"In that case, I won't go as far as saying 'Kill the culprit.' But if you protect me, I'll be happy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah! Leave it to me!"</STYLE><PG>
For <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, living this deep in the mountains and thinking of animals and people as so close, it can't be helped that her view of life and death has drifted from the usual one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I could fix that even a little―
{PAUSE ""}
No, if her view of life and death came closer to mine, that would be something to be glad about.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though if someone called that 'correction' just my own selfishness, there'd be no arguing with it.<PG>
