<STYLE ID="3">"Maybe it's not that </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">your sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> hates you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, but that you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, hate </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">your sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
